"The campus is far larger than it looks; hidden buildings fill the space between the seen ones."
"The lake hall is the only building outside the walls; everything else hides within them."
"A hidden door in the wall leads to the lake; it is folded onto a slightly higher plane."
"The lake's water dims arcanic sense; arcanic reach cannot pierce it."
"The Spire's shadow in the arcanic sea funnels calls toward the lake."
"No trains come in during breaks, and no one but staff should be on campus then."
